[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0010","text":"────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0020","text":"我还要再练一会儿，你呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0030","text":"……\n不好意思……那个，我接下来还有工作————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0040","text":"这样啊\n那就没办法了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0050","text":"……是的\n那我先失陪了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0060","text":"嗯\n辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0070","text":"好累啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0080","text":"虽然肚子饿了，\n但已经过了9点了，还是算了吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0090","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0100","text":"啊\n这些人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0000","text":"音乐节目主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0110","text":"────为纪念出道30周年而\n重新结成的‘芙瓦奇丝’……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0001","text":"音乐节目主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0120","text":"在电视上表演\n是时隔多少年了呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0002","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0130","text":"嗯……大概时隔25年？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0003","text":"芙瓦奇丝2"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0140","text":"哇，有那么久～？\n……啊——能好好表演吗～。开始紧张了————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0004","text":"音乐节目主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0150","text":"……就在我们说话间，\n舞台已经准备就绪了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0005","text":"音乐节目主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0160","text":"那么，请各位准备上场！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0170","text":"哇……动作倒是没记错，\n但总觉得，动作好僵硬啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0180","text":"真亏你能这副状态上电视啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0190","text":"……不过，30年啊────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_00_0200","text":"……30年"}]
